    <string name="about_licenses_text">%1$s is free software under the AGPL-3.0 license. This app uses AndroidX, Jetpack Compose, Media3 (ExoPlayer), OkHttp, Coil and kotlinx.serialization (Apache 2.0), and the Geist typeface (SIL OFL 1.1).</string>
